{
  "sn22.5:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 22.5 ",
  "sn22.5:0.2": "1. Nakulapituvagga ",
  "sn22.5:0.3": "Samādhisutta ",
  "sn22.5:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn22.5:1.2": "…pe… sāvatthiyaṁ … ",
  "sn22.5:1.3": "tatra kho …pe… etadavoca: ",
  "sn22.5:1.4": "“samādhiṁ, bhikkhave, bhāvetha; ",
  "sn22.5:1.5": "samāhito, bhikkhave, bhikkhu yathābhūtaṁ pajānāti. ",
  "sn22.5:1.6": "Kiñca yathābhūtaṁ pajānāti? ",
  "sn22.5:1.7": "Rūpassa samudayañca atthaṅgamañca, vedanāya samudayañca atthaṅgamañca, saññāya samudayañca atthaṅgamañca, saṅkhārānaṁ samudayañca atthaṅgamañca, viññāṇassa samudayañca atthaṅgamañca. ",
  "sn22.5:2.1": "Ko ca, bhikkhave, rūpassa samudayo, ko vedanāya samudayo, ko saññāya samudayo, ko saṅkhārānaṁ samudayo, ko viññāṇassa samudayo? ",
  "sn22.5:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu abhinandati abhivadati ajjhosāya tiṭṭhati. ",
  "sn22.5:3.1": "Kiñca abhinandati abhivadati ajjhosāya tiṭṭhati? ",
  "sn22.5:3.2": "Rūpaṁ abhinandati abhivadati ajjhosāya tiṭṭhati. ",
  "sn22.5:3.3": "Tassa rūpaṁ abhinandato abhivadato ajjhosāya tiṭṭhato uppajjati nandī. ",
  "sn22.5:3.4": "Yā rūpe nandī tadupādānaṁ. ",
  "sn22.5:3.5": "Tassupādānapaccayā bhavo; ",
  "sn22.5:3.6": "bhavapaccayā jāti; ",
  "sn22.5:3.7": "jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṁ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti. ",
  "sn22.5:3.8": "Evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti. ",
  "sn22.5:4.1": "Veda